{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-1",
      "transcript": "A Venus flytrap has no brain. Yet a touch can leave a fading memory.",
      "file": "audio/flytrap/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 4.9,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flytrap-touch-memory.asset.fading-trace.script.1",
      "samples": 117600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-2",
      "transcript": "A brief bend of a sensitive hair can send an electrical signal through the trap while it stays open.",
      "file": "audio/flytrap/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 5.266666666666667,
      "duration": 6.475,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flytrap-touch-memory.asset.fading-trace.script.2",
      "samples": 155400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Alongside that signal, calcium rises inside the leaf’s cells.",
      "file": "audio/flytrap/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 12.333333333333334,
      "duration": 4.45,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flytrap-touch-memory.asset.fading-trace.script.3",
      "samples": 106800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-4",
      "transcript": "Then the calcium level falls. For a short time, part of that change remains.",
      "file": "audio/flytrap/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 17.1,
      "duration": 5.15,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flytrap-touch-memory.asset.fading-trace.script.4",
      "samples": 123600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Another signal arriving soon enough raises the level further. If it reaches the level needed for closure, the trap can snap shut.",
      "file": "audio/flytrap/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 22.966666666666665,
      "duration": 8.3,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flytrap-touch-memory.asset.fading-trace.script.5",
      "samples": 199200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-6",
      "transcript": "Wait too long, and the next signal may no longer reach that level.",
      "file": "audio/flytrap/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 32.1,
      "duration": 4.275,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flytrap-touch-memory.asset.fading-trace.script.6",
      "samples": 102600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-7",
      "transcript": "Two signals don’t always mean two touches: one slower hair movement can produce both.",
      "file": "audio/flytrap/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 37.06666666666667,
      "duration": 5.65,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flytrap-touch-memory.asset.fading-trace.script.7",
      "samples": 135600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-8",
      "transcript": "Here, memory means retained information—a fading chemical state, not conscious recollection.",
      "file": "audio/flytrap/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 43.333333333333336,
      "duration": 6.525,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flytrap-touch-memory.asset.fading-trace.script.8",
      "samples": 156600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
